o\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span>💬</span>&nbsp;<span>我們的理念</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span>誠信、效率、專業、在地。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span>兆旭不動產，用心打造每一段圓滿的成交旅程</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、公園綠地、學校。\r\n本房屋近金龍國小公車站、北峰里公車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "汐止區康寧街", "lat": "25.0681038", "lng": "121.6304692", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "湖前街口站", "distance": 107, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約107公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "金龍市場[新巴士]站", "distance": 111, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約111公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "金龍市場站", "distance": 133, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約133公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "restaurant", "name": "九聚輕和風日式涮涮鍋", "distance": 4, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約4公尺"}, {"type": "shop", "name": "客來樂彩卷行", "distance": 234, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約234公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市汐止區金龍國民小學", "distance": 281, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約281公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "name": "臺北市立東湖國民中學", "distance": 1156, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約1156公尺"}]}]}, "cost": {"title": "費用詳情", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "租金", "value": "10,000元/月", "key": "rentPrice"}, {"name": "押金", "value": "二個月", "key": "deposit"}, {"name": "服務費", "value": "收取服務費", "key": "serviceFee"}, {"name": "租金含", "value": "水費、網路、第四台", "key": "priceContainText"}]}, "information": {"title": "基礎資料", "active": 1, "data": [{"name": "產權登記", "value": "房屋已辦產權登記", "key": "hasCertificate", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "法定用途", "value": "見使照", "key": "purpose", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "可使用面積", "value": "6坪", "key": "area", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "屋齡", "value": "53年", "key": "age", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "電梯", "value": "無", "key": "lift", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "隔間材料", "value": "水泥磚牆", "key": "spacematerial", "alias": "", "cate": 2}, {"name": "陽台", "value": "1陽台", "key": "balcony", "alias": "", "cate": 1}, {"name": "其他特色", "value"